<title>SWEDEN: Swedish producer prices fell 0.4 pct in August.</title>
<headline>Swedish producer prices fell 0.4 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish producer prices fell 0.4 percent in August, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> (Percentage change)		  Aug 96	 yr/yr</p>
<p> Producer prices			-0.4	    -5.0</p>
<p> Import prices			  -0.1	    -6.0</p>
<p> Export prices			  -0.7	    -8.6</p>
<p>Note - The market had expected PPI to rise by 0.1 percent in August, according to a Reuter survey of 18 analysts.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
</text>
